# m6_identity: a long god-mode run (debug_god at 31: hits are ignored, so the run is
# deterministic for 12000 updates) through two stages and their bosses into the third boss's
# fight with every weapon at high level, three forks and three hold-B rewinds. Input: A at
# 30, still fire 60..239, then m2_play's sweep (up 40 / hold 20 / down 40 / hold 20) to
# 12000, B held 5100..5119, 7000..7019 and 10780..10809. debug_history_check (0 = the world
# rebuilt from keyframe + input log is identical, every field) is checked with ghosts, beams,
# seekers and crates in flight, on held frames and on the first frames after each release; it
# is 0 on every frame from 31 on (checked frame by frame when re-pinned; the pins are a sample).
# Re-pinned for the catch-up clock (waves come sooner on a thin field, so the bosses and the
# crates come earlier): the third hold moved from 10500..10529 to 10780..10809 so that it
# still goes back past a boss's spawn (the Schrodinbug's now; the Mandelbug's before).
# Weapon (kind * 10 + level, F 0, A 1, B 2): F2 at 780, F3 1292, A3 1597 (swap), A4 1942,
# A5 2484, B5 2852, F5 5238, A5 7335, then B5 and A5 crates in turn from 9627. Forks at
# 1345, 2058 and 2399 (3 ghosts). The Heisenbug (2833) dies at 3873 (stage 2 from there),
# the Mandelbug (6295) at 7817 (stage 3); the shield (1687) is never used up under god mode.
# - 4000: B5 seekers from the ship and three ghosts' level-1 seekers (more than 30 bolts);
#   4890 the peak (over 60).
# - Hold 1: 5100 (first held frame, game tick 5067) .. 5119 (tick 5029, fuel 140), in
#   stage 2's waves; 5120 is the release (no tick), 5121 the first live tick.
# - Hold 2: 7000 .. 7019 in the Mandelbug's fight, release 7020, live 7021.
# - Hold 3: 10780 .. 10809 (tick 10567, fuel 120), release 10810, live 10811: the
#   Schrodinbug spawned at 10772 (tick 10620); 10782 (tick 10621) still has it, 10783 (tick
#   10619) is before its spawn (no boss, the WARNING again), and it comes again at 10863.
#   11999 is the last update.
--frames 12000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_stage_clears,debug_world_size --at "2300 debug_forks == 2" --at "2300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2398 debug_forks == 2" --at "2399 debug_forks == 3" --at "2483 debug_weapon == 14" --at "2484 debug_weapon == 15" --at "2851 debug_weapon == 15" --at "2852 debug_weapon == 25" --at "3600 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3872 debug_stage_clears == 0" --at "3873 debug_stage_clears == 1" --at "4000 debug_weapon == 25" --at "4000 debug_bolts > 30" --at "4000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4890 debug_bolts > 60" --at "4890 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5100 debug_state == 5" --at "5100 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5110 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5119 debug_state == 5" --at "5119 debug_game_tick == 5029" --at "5119 debug_fuel == 140" --at "5119 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5120 debug_state == 1" --at "5120 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5121 debug_history_check == 0" --at "5237 debug_weapon == 25" --at "5238 debug_weapon == 5" --at "6300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7000 debug_state == 5" --at "7000 debug_boss_id == 1" --at "7010 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7019 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7020 debug_state == 1" --at "7020 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7021 debug_history_check == 0" --at "7335 debug_weapon == 15" --at "7817 debug_stage_clears == 2" --at "8000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "9000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10000 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10772 debug_boss_id == 2" --at "10780 debug_state == 5" --at "10782 debug_boss_id == 2" --at "10783 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "10783 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10795 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10809 debug_game_tick == 10567" --at "10809 debug_fuel == 120" --at "10809 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10810 debug_state == 1" --at "10810 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10811 debug_history_check == 0" --at "10862 debug_boss_id == 255" --at "10863 debug_boss_id == 2" --at "11999 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_forks == 3" --expect "debug_weapon == 25" --expect "debug_stage_clears == 2" --expect "debug_state == 1"
